: 18px;\">Green beans are heated to about 200 C. Light roasts keep fruity notes; dark roasts taste smoky and bitter.</span></p>", "defaultFontName": "", "defaultColor": "#333333", "lineHeight": 1.4}]}, {"id": "s4", "background": {"type": "solid", "color": "#ffffff"}, "elements": [{"type": "text", "id": "t4", "left": 60, "top": 40, "width": 880, "height": 60, "rotate": 0, "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 32px;\">Coffee Today</span></p>", "defaultFontName": "", "defaultColor": "#333333", "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"type": "text", "id": "b4", "left": 60, "top": 130, "width": 880, "height": 200, "rotate": 0, "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Over two billion cups are drunk every day across the world.</span></p>", "defaultFontName": "", "defaultColor": "#333333", "lineHeight": 1.4}]}], "theme": {"themeColors": ["#4472C4", "#ED7D31", "#A5A5A5", "#FFC000", "#5B9BD5", "#70AD47"], "fontColor": "#333", "fontName": "", "backgroundColor": "#fff", "shadow": {"h": 3, "v": 3, "blur": 2, "color": "#808080"}, "outline": {"width": 2, "color": "#525252", "style": "solid"}}, "viewportRatio": 0.5625}